# Normalise line endings in the repository to LF.
#
# Git for Windows sets core.autocrlf=true at the system level, which produces
# the "LF will be replaced by CRLF" warnings and hands CRLF to tools on
# checkout. Declaring it here overrides that config, so Windows, the VPS and the
# container all see the same bytes regardless of any machine's git settings.
* text=auto eol=lf
